          "pali": "samādhisambojjhaṅgaṃ bhāveti …pe…"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn43.12:10.10",
          "pali": "upekkhāsambojjhaṅgaṃ bhāveti vivekanissitaṃ virāganissitaṃ nirodhanissitaṃ vossaggapariṇāmiṃ. Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, asaṅkhatagāmimaggo …pe…."
