        },
        {
          "id": "sn43.12:11.15",
          "pali": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu sammāsamādhiṃ bhāveti vivekanissitaṃ virāganissitaṃ nirodhanissitaṃ vossaggapariṇāmiṃ."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn43.12:11.16",
          "pali": "Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, asaṅkhatagāmimaggo."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn43.12:11.17",
          "pali": "Iti kho, bhikkhave, desitaṃ vo mayā asaṅkhataṃ, desito asaṅkhatagāmimaggo."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn43.12:11.18",
          "pali": "Yaṃ, bhikkhave, satthārā karaṇīyaṃ sāvakānaṃ hitesinā anukampakena anukampaṃ upādāya, kataṃ vo taṃ mayā."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn43.12:11.19",
          "pali": "Etāni, bhikkhave, rukkhamūlāni, etāni suññāgārāni. Jhāyatha, bhikkhave, mā pamādattha; mā pacchā vippaṭisārino ahuvattha. Ayaṃ vo amhākaṃ anusāsanī”ti."
        },
